      "id": "find-or-create-thumbnail-info-531e4d",
      "name": "FindOrCreateThumbnailInfo",
      "category": "AssetDefinitionDefault",
      "signature": "FindOrCreateThumbnailInfo(Target, Asset Object, Thumbnail Class)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "UAssetDefinitionDefault*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Asset Object",
          "type": "UObject*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Thumbnail Class",
          "type": "TSubclassOf<UThumbnailInfo>"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "UThumbnailInfo*",
      "docs": "This function will find or set a new thumbnail info on the object if it either does not exist or the types don't\nmatch.  This function has some requirements, such as the property MUST minimally exist as such,\nUPROPERTY(Instanced)\nTObjectPtr<class UThumbnailInfo> ThumbnailInfo;\nIf your class needs the thumbnail to be set using a Setter/Getter, that's ok, you can have\nGetter=GetThumbnailInfo, Setter=SetThumbnailInfo, in the UProperty declaration to take advantage of native\nsetters and getters."
    },
